  "label": "Child's disgust expression",
  "description": "The boy's facial expression — slightly confused, with melted popsicle on his lips — is used to imply that he is reacting to the unpleasant taste described in the text. This expression is culturally understood as a child's reaction to something gross or unexpected, which enhances the humor of the meme. The meme relies on the viewer's understanding of childhood reactions to food to interpret the boy's expression as one of shock or revulsion.",
